      {
        "conditionKey": "nicoleElementalSkillAtkBuff",
        "source": "Nicole",
        "description": "Elemental Skill (Revelation: Uncreated Light) — Grace of Kenosis grants nearby party members ATK equal to 15% of Nicole's ATK, capped at 600 (\"off-field\"); the cap is what is modelled here. A1 Methexis upgrades it to Guidance of Theosis on a character that has been on-field 3s (or immediately for a Hexerei character), adding a flat +300 = 900 (\"on-field\"). The grant is talent-scaled, so C3 — which raises Revelation: Uncreated Light by 3 levels to Lv13 — takes the ratio to 17.7% and the cap to 708, hence 708 / 1008 from C3 upward (the A1's +300 is a passive constant and does not scale). That is the constellationStates block below. The C2 +300 (c2GuidanceEnhance) stacks on top of this.",
        "states": [
          {
            "value": "off-field (Grace of Kenosis)",
            "modifiers": {
              "atk": 600
            }
          },
          {
            "value": "on-field (Guidance of Theosis)",
            "modifiers": {
              "atk": 900
            }
