        "description": "C2: when a party member's Grace of Kenosis upgrades to Guidance of Theosis (via Nicole's Elemental Skill) they gain an additional 300 ATK, and nearby opponents' RES is decreased by 25% to Pyro AND to the active character's element - not to every element, which is what this used to apply. Pick the state matching the on-field character's element; 'pyro' is the mono-Pyro case where the two coincide. The +300 ATK stacks on top of the base Grace of Kenosis/Guidance of Theosis ATK.",
