      {
        "conditionKey": "c4PathfindersBlessing",
        "source": "Nicole",
        "description": "C4: when a party member upgrades to Guidance of Theosis, Nicole grants them Pathfinder's Blessing for 20s (once every 16s per character): Normal/Charged/Plunging Attack, Elemental Skill, and Elemental Burst DMG increased by 70% of Nicole's ATK. This scales off Nicole's own ATK (the source), not the receiving teammate's, so type this leaderboard's Nicole ATK into the input for an exact value; leaving it blank assumes 2000 ATK. The three preset states are kept as coarse fallbacks. Applied as the five attack-type-scoped flat DMG increases rather than all_dmgInc, since the blessing only fires on those five DMG categories — Nicole's own Arcane Projections belong to none of them and must not collect it. Not modelled: the effect is removed after 8 procs, so a very long rotation over-counts it.",
